e able to respond back  to people that leave reviews on their  articles and kind of create a dialog  because the whole idea here is to  increase the dialogue the conversation  between the journalists the news outlets  and consumers so that people get you  know a better end product a better  experience they get better news very  very interesting idea we've been  speaking with Austen Walter who's the  co-founder of tribe worthy you can learn  more about it online Austin will be  following it I really appreciate you  talking to me about  this yeah thank you

